Package: rstudiocli
Type: Package
Title: R-Side Bridge for rstudio-cli
Version: 0.14.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Alain",
    family = "Clement",
    email = "alain.clement@unil.ch",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0448-9766"))
Description: Canonical R-side surface used by the rstudio-cli binary
    and its MCP server. Wraps the subset of rstudioapi that rstudio-cli
    needs, with AI-native ergonomics: structured list returns, robust
    id/path resolution, and uniform error reporting via stop(). Can be
    used standalone in any R session (RStudio Desktop or Server) to
    script editor / pane / terminal / project / job / preference
    actions without going through the CLI.
